 <a href=\"https://markloops.com/\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">Markloops</a> bought this book for all employees to read and the book was great. It really refreshes the mind. We totally recommend it","stars":"5","reviewer":"Markloops","reviewdate":"2023-08-10 04:44:28","createdate":"2023-08-10 04:44:28","reviewer_itemname":"@markloops"}],"server":"ia800107.us.archive.org","uniq":2033101354,"workable_servers":["ia800107.us.archive.org","ia600107.us.archive.org"]}